\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces System architecture and inter-device communication model. In the wearable unit, Core\nobreakspace  {}1 executes the 50\,Hz kinematic pointing pipeline (MPU-6886 sampling, bias correction, non-linear velocity control law, and NimBLE HID mouse reporting). Core\nobreakspace  {}0 runs the power and web subsystem (AXP192 telemetry, asynchronous HTTP server, and 20\,Hz WebSocket broadcast over Wi-Fi). On the host device, the OS input stack receives BLE reports to steer the native cursor, while the browser executes the self-hosted bilingual AAC communicator with dwell selection and multi-engine speech synthesis.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{2}{4}}
