\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Transfer function of the control law for $\theta =1.20$\,\ensuremath  {^{\circ }}/s{} and $K=0.60$. (a) Near the threshold, the simple threshold jumps to one count at $\theta $, whereas threshold subtraction starts from zero and gives its first count at $\omega _{\mathrm  {on}}\approx 2.03$\,\ensuremath  {^{\circ }}/s{} because of rounding. (b) Over the full range the output grows linearly and saturates at 127 counts at $\omega _{\mathrm  {sat}}\approx 212$\,\ensuremath  {^{\circ }}/s. At 50 reports per second, one count per report equals 50 counts/s.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:transfer}{{5}{7}}
